WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.540
Number seven, your purpose and direction.

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.360
Does the direction you’re taking reflect what matters to you

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.690
You can be doing well in something and still

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:09.710
feel completely disconnected and you might just

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:10.600
be starting out

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.600
But it's actually what you want to do

